{"compact": {"ja_sv": "Utskottets förslag: att avslå motionsyrkandena (nuvarande ordning behålls).", "nej_sv": "Stöd för motförslaget: reservation 6 från V.", "avstar_sv": "Partiet markerar en egen linje som inte finns med i slutomröstningens två alternativ.", "ja_en": "The committee proposal: rejecting the motions (keeping things as they are).", "nej_en": "Backing the counter-proposal: reservation 6 by V.", "avstar_en": "The party marks a position of its own that is not one of the two final alternatives."}, "en": {"rubrik": "Gender equality and women, peace and security", "dok_titel": "International relations etc.", "forslag_text": "The Riksdag rejects the motions\n\n2024/25:870 by Lotta Johnsson Fornarve et al. (V) demands 2, 3 and 6,\n\n2024/25:2625 by Janine Alm Ericson et al. (MP) demands 9 and 10,\n\n2024/25:3038 by Daniel Helldén et al. (MP) demand 2,\n\n2024/25:3106 by Morgan Johansson et al. (S) demand 19 and\n\n2024/25:3107 by Morgan Johansson et al. (S) demands 29, 36 and 37.", "notis": "The Riksdag rejected approximately 130 proposals in motions about international relations.\nThe motions were submitted during the general motion period 2024 and concern, among other things, international cooperation, gender equality and women, peace and security, relations with China and consular matters.", "alternatives": ["The Riksdag rejects the motions\n\n2024/25:870 by Lotta Johnsson Fornarve et al. (V) demands 2, 3 and 6,\n\n2024/25:2625 by Janine Alm Ericson et al. (MP) demands 9 and 10,\n\n2024/25:3038 by Daniel Helldén et al. (MP) demand 2,\n\n2024/25:3106 by Morgan Johansson et al. (S) demand 19 and\n\n2024/25:3107 by Morgan Johansson et al. (S) demands 29, 36 and 37.", "Reservation 6"]}, "votering_id": "BA4DC857-7AE3-4914-BD91-39514EF8B406", "rm": "2024/25", "beteckning": "UU7", "punkt": 2, "dok_id": "HC01UU7", "datum": "2025-05-14", "utskott": "UU", "rubrik": "Jämställdhet samt kvinnor, fred och säkerhet", "dok_titel": "Internationella relationer m.m.", "samma